  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-24",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "过激的处理  (PR Director Stella Clashes With Production)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "PR director Stella brings an aggressive media counter-plan to the chief editor office. Let us listen to her clash with the production team over how to handle the crisis.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "怎么了？淳于总不在啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "辛惠美闹那件事，属于系列行动，有娱记串通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在事态紧迫，我们已经拟好了危机公关方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是这样，淳总呢，不想过激处理这件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他的意思是，我们的方案过激了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那辛惠美过不过激呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "淳于乔他不想过激处理这件事，自己就别惹出这么过激的烂事啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "斯戴拉！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "怎么说这个是总编室，你做公关的，你说话给我注意点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "好，请你们转告淳于乔，他自己的名誉澄不澄清我管不着。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stella enters the room demanding to know where the chief producer is.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "怎么了？淳于总不在啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stella walks into the office and asks \"zenme le\", meaning 'what is wrong'.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "辛惠美闹那件事，属于系列行动，有娱记串通。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She describes Xin Huimei's actions as \"nao\", meaning 'to make a fuss'.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在事态紧迫，我们已经拟好了危机公关方案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She says the situation is \"jinpo\" or 'urgent', and that they have drafted a plan for \"gongguan\", meaning 'public relations'.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是这样，淳总呢，不想过激处理这件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi explains that Chun Yuqiao does not want to be \"guoji\" or 'too aggressive.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他的意思是，我们的方案过激了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stella asks if his \"yisi\" or 'meaning.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那辛惠美过不过激呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She angrily asks if Xin Huimei was \"guoji\" or 'too aggressive.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "淳于乔他不想过激处理这件事，自己就别惹出这么过激的烂事啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She calls the scandal a \"lan shi\" or 'messy matter', and says he should not have caused it himself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "斯戴拉！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He finally speaks up and calls her by name.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "怎么说这个是总编室，你做公关的，你说话给我注意点。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He reminds her that this is the \"zongbianshi\" or 'chief editor office', and tells her to \"zhuyi\" or 'pay attention.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "好，请你们转告淳于乔，他自己的名誉澄不澄清我管不着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She tells them to pass the message that she does not care if he clears his \"mingyu\" or 'reputation'.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "怎么了？淳于总不在啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "辛惠美闹那件事，属于系列行动，有娱记串通。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在事态紧迫，我们已经拟好了危机公关方案。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "是这样，淳总呢，不想过激处理这件事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他的意思是，我们的方案过激了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "那辛惠美过不过激呀！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "淳于乔他不想过激处理这件事，自己就别惹出这么过激的烂事啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "斯戴拉！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "怎么说这个是总编室，你做公关的，你说话给我注意点。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "好，请你们转告淳于乔，他自己的名誉澄不澄清我管不着。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The production and public relations teams clearly have very different ideas on how to manage the crisis. You learned how to say \"nao\" for \"making a fuss\", the word for \"too aggressive\", and how to talk about a messy matter. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
